      "body": "Mitsu Chem Plast Limited disclosed that the Board of Directors at the meeting held on May 28, 2026, announced Retirement on account of completion of second term of Mr. Dilip Khushalchand Gosar (DIN: 07514842) as Independent Director of the Company w.e.f closure of business hours on June 12, 2026. Retirement on account of completion of second term as Independent Director w.e.f. June 12, 2026.",
