      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: Revenue: ₹3.51b (up 5.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹156.2m (up 115% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (up from 2.2% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue.",
