      "date": "2026-05-04T11:53:26.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 30%",
      "body": "After last week's 30% share price gain to ₹134, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 16.8x. Average trailing P/E is 23x in the Chemicals industry in India. Total loss to shareholders of 27% over the past three years.",
